@attribute [Route(GlobalValues.Path_Overview_Roadmap)]

<PageTitle>@GlobalValues.Page_Title_Overview_Roadmap</PageTitle>

<section class="info-box info-box--coloured">

    <h1>@GlobalValues.Page_Heading_Overview_Roadmap</h1>

    <p>
        To some, the order of the componnents that have, and are being built may seem strange, but please remember the emphasis is on accessiblity and the components released thus far (excluding the switch)
        are the ones that in my opinion can have the most impact on accessibility given how poorly they are generally implemented, if at all (from an accessibility standpoint), given there usage.
    </p>
    <p>
        I will also be building child components first, for example the DataTable will require a Pager, a TextDebounce Filter, a DropDownMenuButton for row actions etc but all of these components can be used 
        individually. The other factor I take into account is what I need for the site, for example at some point I will need some collapsing section for the left hand navigation.
    </p>
    <p>
        Unless contacted, I will next be looking at something for the left hand navigation or inputs.
    </p>
    <p>
        After the above, and in no particular order the following components will be developed. Please note all of the components will be fully functional, but may not have all the bells
        and whistles that paid-for components or component frameworks may have.
    </p>
    <p>
        I am focusing on accessibility and inclusivity but I will do my best to add any missing feature that the majority request. I apologise if you are a minority feature
        requester, but I can only do so much in the time I have and I would prefer to reach as wide an audience as I can first, then perhaps refine things.
    </p>
</section>
<section class="info-box">
    <h2 id="planned-components" class="info-box__heading">Planned components</h2>

    <ul aria-labelledby="planned-components">
        <li>
            DataTable
        </li>
        <li>
            DropDownMenuButton
        </li>
        <li>
            Inputs
        </li>
        <li>
            Pager
        </li>
        <li>
            StarRating
        </li>
        <li>
            Heading
        </li>
        <li>
            TextDebounce
        </li>
        <li>
            ToolTip
        </li>
        <li>
            TreeView
        </li>
    </ul>

    <p>
        You are welcome to request a feature and/or a component that you feel should be on the list. To do so just visit the <a class="@GlobalValues.Link_Class" target="_blank" href="https://github.com/BlazorRamp/Components/issues">Issues (opens in a new window)</a>
        section of the repo and from the new issue select the 'Feature request' option.
    </p>

</section>

<div class="flex-content justify-content-between">
    <a class="@GlobalValues.Link_Button_Class @GlobalValues.Link_Button_Left_Arrow_Modifier" href="@GlobalValues.Path_Overview_Accessibility">
        <span aria-hidden="true"></span>
        <span>@GlobalValues.Main_Nav_Section_Heading_About - @GlobalValues.Page_Heading_Overview_Accessibility</span>
        <span aria-hidden="true"></span>
    </a>
    <a class="@GlobalValues.Link_Button_Class @GlobalValues.Link_Button_Right_Arrow_Modifier" href="@GlobalValues.Path_Theming_Overview">
        <span aria-hidden="true"></span>
        <span>@GlobalValues.Main_Nav_Section_Heading_Theming - @GlobalValues.Page_Heading_Theming_Overview</span>
        <span aria-hidden="true"></span>
    </a>
</div>